From: FE Fates port <engine@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] frontend: Fire Emblem Fates: the Seal of Flames page names roms/seal (F-048)

The Install button runs tools/play/sof.py install, which now finds the
download zip in roms/seal (any depth; the old root folder for one
release). Only the "Not installed" text changes. Applies after 0026.
---
diff --git a/crates/zakuro/src/game_pick.rs b/crates/zakuro/src/game_pick.rs
index e3eabbc..0275d05 100644
--- a/crates/zakuro/src/game_pick.rs
+++ b/crates/zakuro/src/game_pick.rs
@@ -167,7 +167,7 @@ impl SealStatus {
     pub fn reason(&self) -> Option<String> {
         match self {
             SealStatus::Installed => None,
-            SealStatus::Missing => Some("Not installed. Put the Seal of Flames v6 download in the port folder, then press Install.".into()),
+            SealStatus::Missing => Some("Not installed. Put the Seal of Flames download zip (still zipped) in the roms\\seal folder, then press Install.".into()),
             SealStatus::Broken(why) => Some(format!("Needs repair ({why}): press Install again (your saves are kept).")),
         }
     }
